WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.859
So an ‘ecorithm’ is a procedure or algorithm
which interacts with the world and learns

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:07.240
from it.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.280
One can think of it as either being run on
a computer or on a biological system like

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.099
a brain.

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:19.500
So it encompasses the idea of machine learning,
by which computers learn, but it’s intended

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.140
to be a more general term.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:28.020
So for example it is intended to encompass
biological evolution and also computer methods

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:33.019
which learn to become more intelligent and
and are able to reason.

